/Title (Diligence & Strategic Leadership: In 2009 Event Capital Markets merged with Analytical Research and Mr. Sweeney was a day-one hire at the newly formed firm. He helped this European-based consultant grow to $3 billion AUA invested across 15 single funds and 20 hedge fund of funds. During his time, he served as Managing Partner, Director of Research and Chief Strategist. The firm embarked upon building proprietary hedge fund database software, a project Mr. Sweeney embraced, but also learned internal software development 10 to 15 years ago is costly and slow versus off-the-shelf solutions.)
