/Title (Situation:  A rapidly growing $20B wealth management platform lacks hedge fund coverage, limiting service to high-net-worth clients and creating gaps in manager due diligence, operational monitoring, and NYC-based sourcing. Building this offering internally risks poor manager selection, missed red flags, and regulatory exposure. The platform needs institutional-grade hedge fund coverage without the cost and complexity of building an internal team.)
